            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="der-color">Der Erfolg</span></strong> ist wichtig.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>Success is important.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>El éxito es importante.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich wünsche <strong><span class="der-color">den Erfolg</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I wish for success.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Deseo el éxito.</i></span></td>
