          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Substantiv"><strong><span class="der-color">der Fehler</span></strong> <br/> ❌</td>
            <td data-label="Aussprache Englisch Spanisch">🇩🇪 /FE-ler/<span class="translation"> <br/> 🇬🇧 <i>Mistake</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Error</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Das ist ein <strong><span class="der-color">Fehler</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>That is a mistake.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Eso es un error.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Jeder macht <strong><span class="der-color">Fehler</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>Everyone makes mistakes.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Todos cometen errores.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="der-color">Der Fehler</span></strong> ist normal.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>The mistake is normal.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>El error es normal.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich mache <strong><span class="der-color">den Fehler</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I make a mistake.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Cometo el error.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="der-color">ein</span></strong> großer <strong><span class="der-color">Fehler</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>This is a big mistake.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Este es un gran error.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich mache <strong><span class="der-color">einen</span></strong> großen <strong><span class="der-color">Fehler</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I make a big mistake.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Cometo un gran error.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="der-color">Kein Fehler</span></strong> ist da.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>No mistake is there.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>No hay error.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Akkusativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="der-color">kein Fehler</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>That is no mistake.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Eso no es error.</i></span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Substantiv"><strong><span class="das-color">das Problem</span></strong> <br/> ❗</td>
            <td data-label="Aussprache Englisch Spanisch">🇩🇪 /pro-BLEM/<span class="translation"> <br/> 🇬🇧 <i>Problem</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Problema</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Wir haben ein <strong><span class="das-color">Problem</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>We have a problem.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Tenemos un problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Das ist kein <strong><span class="das-color">Problem</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>That is no problem.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Eso no es problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="das-color">Das Problem</span></strong> ist schwer.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>The problem is difficult.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>El problema es difícil.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich löse <strong><span class="das-color">das Problem</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I solve the problem.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Resuelvo el problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="das-color">ein</span></strong> großes <strong><span class="das-color">Problem</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>This is a big problem.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Este es un gran problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich habe <strong><span class="das-color">ein</span></strong> großes <strong><span class="das-color">Problem</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I have a big problem.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Tengo un gran problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="das-color">Kein Problem</span></strong> ist da.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>No problem is there.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>No hay problema.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Akkusativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="das-color">kein Problem</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>That is no problem.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Eso no es problema.</i></span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td data-label="Substantiv"><strong><span class="die-color">die Lösung</span></strong> <br/> 💡</td>
            <td data-label="Aussprache Englisch Spanisch">🇩🇪 /LÖ-zung/<span class="translation"> <br/> 🇬🇧 <i>Solution</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Solución</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Das ist eine gute <strong><span class="die-color">Lösung</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>That is a good solution.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Esa es una buena solución.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Ich suche eine <strong><span class="die-color">Lösung</span></strong>.</span> <span class="translation"><br/> 🇬🇧 <i>I seek a solution.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Busco una solución.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="die-color">Die Lösung</span></strong> ist einfach.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>The solution is simple.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>La solución es simple.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich finde <strong><span class="die-color">die Lösung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I find the solution.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Encuentro la solución.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Lösung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>This is a good solution.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Esta es una buena solución.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich suche <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Lösung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I seek a good solution.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Busco una buena solución.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="die-color">Keine Lösung</span></strong> ist da.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>No solution is there.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>No hay solución.</i></span></td>
