            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Ich habe eine <strong><span class="die-color">Frage</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"> <br/> 🇬🇧 <i>I have a question.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Tengo una pregunta.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Beispielsatz"><span>Das ist eine wichtige <strong><span class="die-color">Frage</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"> <br/> 🇬🇧 <i>That is an important question.</i> <br/> 🇪🇸 <i>Esa es una pregunta importante.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="die-color">Die Frage</span></strong> ist wichtig.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>The question is important.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>La pregunta es importante.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich stelle <strong><span class="die-color">die Frage</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I ask the question.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Hago la pregunta.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Frage</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>This is a good question.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Esta es una buena pregunta.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich habe <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Frage</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I have a good question.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Tengo una buena pregunta.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Negation (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="die-color">Keine Frage</span></strong> ist da.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>No question is there.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>No hay pregunta.</i></span></td>
