            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span><strong><span class="die-color">Die Antwort</span></strong> ist richtig.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>The answer is correct.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>La respuesta es correcta.</i></span></td>
