            <td data-label="Definiter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich habe <strong><span class="die-color">die Erinnerung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I have the memory.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Tengo el recuerdo.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Nominativ)"><span>Das ist <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Erinnerung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>This is a good memory.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Este es un buen recuerdo.</i></span></td>
            <td data-label="Indefiniter Artikel (Akkusativ)"><span>Ich teile <strong><span class="die-color">eine</span></strong> gute <strong><span class="die-color">Erinnerung</span></strong>.</span><span class="translation"><br/>🇬🇧 <i>I share a good memory.</i><br/>🇪🇸 <i>Comparto un buen recuerdo.</i></span></td>
